+"""Bounded, inert MHTML/MHT read/create and preserving literal-text edits.
+
+The supported profile is a flat multipart/related MIME message with an explicit
+HTML document.  MIME start selects a Content-ID; absent start, part zero is the
+root.  No files, URLs, renderers, scripts, or external services are used.
